WEBVTT

00:00:08.790 --> 00:00:09.790
Is that...

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:12.700
...a mummy?

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:15.200
It looks like a princess or something to me.

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:29.160
Cecil!

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:33.450
Th-The body...

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:34.750
Chapman...

00:00:47.660 --> 00:00:48.790
Did I get her?

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:00.750
Damn you...

00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:01.830
Tilarna!

00:01:01.830 --> 00:01:03.040
Get back, Kei!

00:01:16.450 --> 00:01:17.450
Shit!

00:01:19.450 --> 00:01:22.040
What the hell was that thing?

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:27.250
A lauden neiven. In your language, a "vampire."

00:01:27.250 --> 00:01:31.330
A vampire? I thought she was
some kind of weird pervert.

00:03:08.870 --> 00:03:13.750
So that shriveled-up corpse turned into
a hot naked chick and attacked somebody?

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:16.540
Not a chance. Did she just
plump up like instant ramen?

00:03:16.540 --> 00:03:18.450
It wasn't a body.

00:03:18.450 --> 00:03:22.120
Lauden neiven possess
terrifying regenerative powers.

00:03:22.120 --> 00:03:24.200
No matter how much damage their bodies take,

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:27.370
they can absorb latena,
the power humans use to live, and revive.

00:03:27.370 --> 00:03:29.910
I see. Vampires, huh?

00:03:29.910 --> 00:03:32.450
Their race was destroyed many years ago.

00:03:32.450 --> 00:03:34.950
But I guess one survived.

00:03:34.950 --> 00:03:39.580
If I'd only been more cautious,
I would've noticed sooner.

00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:41.540
But I let someone die.

00:03:41.540 --> 00:03:43.750
You saved Cecil, right?

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:45.000
But...

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:46.660
Don't let it get to you.

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:55.450
The more important problem
is that the monster's still out there.

00:03:55.450 --> 00:03:57.540
We've got an emergency warrant out, but...

00:03:57.540 --> 00:04:01.830
You doreany can't possibly catch her.

00:04:01.830 --> 00:04:03.000
I don't know about that.

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:06.040
My bullets and your sword
seemed to hurt her just fine.

00:04:06.040 --> 00:04:09.120
If she gets surrounded by
a SWAT team, that'll be that.

00:04:09.120 --> 00:04:10.290
SWAT?

00:04:10.290 --> 00:04:11.500
Those guys.

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:15.870
They're athletic and have great aim.

00:04:15.870 --> 00:04:19.410
I don't train at all, so they're
a lot more reliable than me.

00:04:21.370 --> 00:04:23.500
Accuracy doesn't matter.

00:04:23.500 --> 00:04:26.200
What matters is your sense of smell in combat.

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:30.040
For example, why did you have a fire
extinguisher when you ran down to save me?

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:34.660
Because... I don't know.
It just felt like the right thing to do.

00:04:34.660 --> 00:04:37.200
That's what I mean by sense of smell.

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:41.700
You're an unpleasant man,
but in that sense, you're worthy of respect.

00:04:41.700 --> 00:04:43.290
Is that a compliment?

00:04:43.540 --> 00:04:44.950
Idiot.

00:04:44.950 --> 00:04:48.620
I'm concerned about the other "bolicemen."

00:04:48.620 --> 00:04:49.750
I see.

00:04:51.540 --> 00:04:54.000
Lauden neiven are far too dangerous.

00:04:57.830 --> 00:04:59.450
You okay?

00:04:59.450 --> 00:05:02.000
Yeah. I'm getting a ride home.

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:04.080
And Tilarna, thanks.

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:12.370
There's been another victim.

00:05:12.370 --> 00:05:13.450
Where?

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:16.910
Alamo Park. She killed a truck driver.

00:05:16.910 --> 00:05:18.330
We've got witnesses, too.

00:05:18.330 --> 00:05:20.870
Alamo? That's outside the cordon we set up.

00:05:20.870 --> 00:05:22.410
How'd she get so far?

00:05:22.410 --> 00:05:24.370
I called you here to find out.

00:05:24.370 --> 00:05:28.040
Can she move that fast
after she got an arm cut off?

00:05:28.040 --> 00:05:30.750
I don't know. They're an old race.

00:05:30.750 --> 00:05:33.080
"I don't know" isn't good enough.

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:35.540
If we don't find her,
more people are going to die.

00:05:35.540 --> 00:05:37.160
How are you going to fix that?

00:05:37.160 --> 00:05:38.450
Well...

00:05:38.450 --> 00:05:40.660
That's why I was opposed to this.

00:05:40.660 --> 00:05:44.540
No good will come of having
a Semanian on the force.

00:05:44.540 --> 00:05:49.660
Civilized society has its own set of rules,
and this little girl can't--

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:52.950
I think that's enough, Superintendent.

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:56.660
People are dying while
you're standing here bitching.

00:05:56.660 --> 00:05:57.700
What did you say?

00:05:57.700 --> 00:06:01.120
If it weren't for the girl,
Cecil Epps would be dead,

00:06:01.120 --> 00:06:03.200
the vampire would've gotten out
without anybody noticing,

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:05.700
and nobody would've known
a thing was wrong until morning.

00:06:05.700 --> 00:06:09.870
If anything, we're damn lucky
it worked out the way it did.

00:06:09.870 --> 00:06:12.450
Inspector Zimmer, what are you--

00:06:12.450 --> 00:06:15.370
And Exedilica works for me, damn it!

00:06:15.370 --> 00:06:19.290
You got a problem with her,
you come to me first, kid!

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:23.040
Let's go.

00:06:25.290 --> 00:06:26.750
I didn't see that coming.

00:06:26.750 --> 00:06:28.540
He's just a snot-nosed kid.

00:06:28.540 --> 00:06:32.200
He used to piss himself all the time
when he was a new recruit for the LA Police.

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:34.700
What, you got a problem, too?

00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:36.330
Nope. Not at all.

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:39.160
Then don't let every damn thing
surprise you like that, idiot.

00:06:41.870 --> 00:06:43.160
Aye aye, sir.

00:06:44.160 --> 00:06:47.080
Matoba, how would you find her?

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:50.290
We can assume the vampire doesn't
know anything about Earth society.

00:06:50.290 --> 00:06:52.950
She can't do anything fancy to escape.

00:06:52.950 --> 00:06:54.750
A K-9 unit would be the way to go.

00:06:54.750 --> 00:06:57.250
The police dogs are already out there.

00:06:57.250 --> 00:06:58.580
We've got one right here.

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:08.950
So she killed the guy while he was driving,
and the truck crashed?

00:07:08.950 --> 00:07:11.250
Maybe she's an idiot?

00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:13.080
I don't know.

00:07:13.080 --> 00:07:16.290
It's possible she didn't attack the witnesses

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:18.290
because she deliberately wanted them alive.

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:20.660
Let's ask.

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:24.250
Her arms? She had both of them.

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:25.830
She regenerated them, then.

00:07:26.950 --> 00:07:32.910
She got out of the truck and looked at us,
but then she ran that way.

00:07:32.910 --> 00:07:35.540
Was she naked?

00:07:35.540 --> 00:07:38.700
I couldn't tell...

00:07:38.700 --> 00:07:42.080
It felt like she was wearing
a black evening dress, but...

00:07:42.080 --> 00:07:46.250
But it had, like, a haze around it,
and kept shimmering... It was like...

00:07:46.250 --> 00:07:47.580
Like flames?

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:51.910
Yeah. Like black flames burning.

00:07:51.910 --> 00:07:53.830
That's "Vau e Deie."

00:07:53.830 --> 00:07:55.040
"Vau e"...?

00:07:58.790 --> 00:08:00.200
What's that?

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:02.410
One of the basic illusion spells.

00:08:02.410 --> 00:08:04.580
It can also serve as clothing.

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:09.620
Which means she's got enough
of her power back to use magic.

00:08:09.620 --> 00:08:13.410
Can you use this Va... Vau...

00:08:13.410 --> 00:08:16.200
Vau e Deie. And yes, I can.

00:08:18.450 --> 00:08:19.870
Let me see it.

00:08:19.870 --> 00:08:23.580
No. You can't use it
when you're wearing clothes.

00:08:23.580 --> 00:08:26.120
And it disappears immediately
if you lose concentration.

00:08:26.120 --> 00:08:27.620
I see.

00:08:32.200 --> 00:08:33.660
Don't imagine it.

00:08:33.660 --> 00:08:34.950
I am not.

00:08:34.950 --> 00:08:37.200
No, I could tell you were by your face!

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:38.660
I know you're doing it!

00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:41.950
What gives a person of lowly birth like you

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:43.700
--the right to look at me naked?

00:08:43.700 --> 00:08:45.700
--Shut up.
--the right to look at me naked?

00:08:45.700 --> 00:08:48.250
We need to deal with the vampire.
Where'd she go?

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:50.660
Oh, yeah. Let me see...

00:09:11.330 --> 00:09:12.790
That building.

00:09:12.790 --> 00:09:15.290
The shopping mall.

00:09:15.290 --> 00:09:17.750
I think she's in there.

00:09:17.750 --> 00:09:20.500
That's the opposite of the way
the witnesses said she went.

00:09:20.500 --> 00:09:21.750
And the police dogs, too.

00:09:21.750 --> 00:09:25.830
But from that building,
you can overlook this area.

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:31.790
So she left the body for us to find
in order to see how the cops would react.

00:09:33.450 --> 00:09:36.200
Yes. Now that she's filled her belly,

00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:39.500
what she wants most of all
is information about this city.

00:09:39.500 --> 00:09:44.830
She probably thinks she can escape
from most people who'd try to surround her...

00:09:44.830 --> 00:09:47.700
I see. You're smart.

00:09:47.700 --> 00:09:48.750
Was that sarcasm?

00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:51.290
Nope. I'm impressed.

00:09:51.290 --> 00:09:54.250
No, you were insulting me.
I could tell from your voice.

00:09:54.250 --> 00:09:55.620
You're a nasty guy.

00:09:55.620 --> 00:09:58.080
It's true! I...

00:09:58.080 --> 00:10:00.870
Forget it. Anyway, we're off to the mall.

00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:06.830
That's right. I want as many men
down here as you can give me.

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:09.950
But make sure nobody's alone for an instant.

00:10:09.950 --> 00:10:12.290
And if you find her, don't try to catch her.

00:10:14.660 --> 00:10:15.750
Kei.

00:10:15.750 --> 00:10:17.080
Give me a second.

00:10:18.540 --> 00:10:21.160
I can smell the vampire's latena.

00:10:21.160 --> 00:10:23.250
She went inside from here.

00:10:23.250 --> 00:10:24.250
Got it.

00:10:25.450 --> 00:10:28.250
Nothing on the security system, it looks like.

00:10:28.250 --> 00:10:31.000
She didn't trip the lasers.

00:10:31.000 --> 00:10:32.330
You sure?

00:10:32.330 --> 00:10:34.750
Can she see lasers, you think?

00:10:34.750 --> 00:10:36.250
We'll go after her.

00:10:36.250 --> 00:10:38.200
If you find something, call me.

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:49.870
Well?

00:10:49.870 --> 00:10:53.250
She's close.
I can't tell what direction, though.

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:54.120
Ambush?

00:10:54.120 --> 00:10:56.080
Possibly. Stay sharp.

00:11:00.120 --> 00:11:01.250
You're in the way.

00:11:04.250 --> 00:11:05.830
No, you're in the way!

00:11:07.870 --> 00:11:08.950
It's stronger.

00:11:08.950 --> 00:11:10.410
What is?

00:11:10.410 --> 00:11:12.330
Her presence. Be careful.

00:11:13.540 --> 00:11:15.410
Careful of what?

00:11:16.200 --> 00:11:17.200
Kei!

00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:30.500
Kei!

00:11:34.910 --> 00:11:36.200
Damn you!

00:11:44.870 --> 00:11:47.950
Kei! Kei!

00:11:47.950 --> 00:11:50.450
Wake up, Kei!

00:11:50.450 --> 00:11:52.620
Why don't you give him a kiss, Tony?

00:11:52.620 --> 00:11:54.450
It might wake him up.

00:11:54.450 --> 00:11:57.790
Alex, that's sexual harassment.

00:11:57.790 --> 00:11:59.080
For you or him?

00:12:00.790 --> 00:12:02.750
He woke up!

00:12:06.500 --> 00:12:11.080
Tony... Godnov... What are you doing here?

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:14.160
We lost touch with you, so we came to save you!

00:12:14.160 --> 00:12:17.250
And we saw you floating in the fountain...

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:18.410
Where's Tilarna?

00:12:18.410 --> 00:12:21.040
Not here. What happened?

00:12:21.040 --> 00:12:23.750
She was taken...

00:12:23.750 --> 00:12:26.620
That goddamn vampire...

00:12:28.750 --> 00:12:31.330
I'll get her for this.

00:12:31.330 --> 00:12:33.290
You fell from up there?

00:12:33.290 --> 00:12:35.660
I'm amazed you're still alive.

00:12:35.660 --> 00:12:36.950
Got a smoke?

00:12:36.950 --> 00:12:39.580
Nope. I don't smoke.

00:12:39.580 --> 00:12:41.750
I'm amazed you're still alive.

00:12:50.450 --> 00:12:52.870
You're awake, young swordswoman?

00:12:55.830 --> 00:12:57.250
Vampire.

00:12:57.370 --> 00:12:59.500
Why have you not killed me?

00:13:00.450 --> 00:13:02.250
I have questions for you.

00:13:02.700 --> 00:13:04.330
What is this place?

00:13:05.540 --> 00:13:07.080
Such strange letters.

00:13:07.250 --> 00:13:08.910
How do you read them?

00:13:09.160 --> 00:13:13.580
San-Tirysei? No, San-Teresa.

00:13:15.330 --> 00:13:19.950
I see. So this is another world, isn't it?

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:23.500
They call it "Earth."

00:13:24.410 --> 00:13:29.000
So the greater gate spoken of
in the Book of Niba manifested?

00:13:29.620 --> 00:13:31.500
The Book of Niba?

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:34.120
An old legend.

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:36.450
Now then...

00:13:40.330 --> 00:13:45.450
Such a noble scent.
Your blood must taste delicious.

00:13:45.620 --> 00:13:46.790
Monster!

00:13:46.950 --> 00:13:47.660
Oh?

00:13:48.250 --> 00:13:51.950
You killed innocent people!
That's what a beast does!

00:13:53.750 --> 00:13:56.250
You don't seem to understand what hunger is.

00:13:57.330 --> 00:13:59.950
If only we had time...

00:14:04.580 --> 00:14:06.450
Tch. It seems we've been interrupted.

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:09.200
Tilarna!

00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:10.200
Kei!

00:14:11.870 --> 00:14:13.080
Don't resist!

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:14.580
Hands up!

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:16.830
No! She's invincible right now!

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:20.410
Fascinating. How many of you should I eat?

00:14:26.000 --> 00:14:27.080
I can't see her!

00:14:27.080 --> 00:14:29.580
Get them out of here! She'll kill them all!

00:14:33.580 --> 00:14:34.450
What?

00:14:34.660 --> 00:14:36.500
We can see her. This'll work.

00:14:42.330 --> 00:14:44.290
Keep shooting! She's just like a bear!

00:14:44.290 --> 00:14:45.830
Extremely tough...

00:14:56.200 --> 00:14:58.250
Shit. She got away again.

00:14:58.250 --> 00:15:00.500
Tilarna, you okay?

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:01.540
I'm fine.

00:15:03.120 --> 00:15:04.750
Then let's follow her. Come with me.

00:15:06.500 --> 00:15:08.040
What are you doing? Hurry!

00:15:08.040 --> 00:15:10.000
I know that! Don't yell at me!

00:15:12.830 --> 00:15:13.950
Dummy.

00:15:49.370 --> 00:15:51.370
Such terrifying weapons...

00:15:52.450 --> 00:15:53.790
Who are they?

00:15:56.910 --> 00:15:59.330
This isn't just some other world.

00:16:02.250 --> 00:16:05.830
Am I in hell?

00:16:06.450 --> 00:16:09.830
You'll find a grate up ahead.

00:16:10.080 --> 00:16:13.660
Use it to escape underground.

00:16:14.290 --> 00:16:15.660
A spell?

00:16:15.830 --> 00:16:17.750
Hurry.

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:23.330
Why the hell can't we find her?

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:26.000
We've searched every inch of this damn mall!

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:29.750
So maybe she's not in the mall.

00:16:29.750 --> 00:16:33.250
There's a subway 500 meters to the south.

00:16:33.250 --> 00:16:36.290
And it's connected to the
mall's ventilation system.

00:16:36.290 --> 00:16:38.330
An air duct, huh?

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:41.080
It's faster to go around
to the East Plaza Station

00:16:41.080 --> 00:16:43.290
and ambush her than try to go after her.

00:16:43.290 --> 00:16:44.580
I'll send you the location.

00:16:46.330 --> 00:16:47.370
Let's go.

00:16:49.410 --> 00:16:51.870
Damn it, I've been running all the time lately!

00:16:51.870 --> 00:16:53.580
It's gonna make me a healthy man.

00:16:53.580 --> 00:16:55.330
Sounds great to me.

00:16:55.330 --> 00:16:57.700
You won't have to ride in those awful cars.

00:17:01.790 --> 00:17:03.290
I can smell her.

00:17:03.290 --> 00:17:05.290
I think she's close!

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:08.620
So we were right, huh?
I don't know if that's good luck or bad.

00:17:13.250 --> 00:17:14.160
Kei.

00:17:14.160 --> 00:17:15.450
What?

00:17:15.450 --> 00:17:19.080
I want to capture that
vampire alive if possible.

00:17:19.080 --> 00:17:20.580
Don't be stupid!

00:17:20.580 --> 00:17:22.500
You saw how strong she is!

00:17:22.500 --> 00:17:24.620
We can't hold back on her!

00:17:24.620 --> 00:17:27.080
That's why I said "if possible."

00:17:27.080 --> 00:17:30.500
Did talking to her make you sympathetic?

00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:34.660
You take pity on her for having to run
around in a town she's never seen before?

00:17:34.660 --> 00:17:36.000
Well...

00:17:36.000 --> 00:17:39.700
Don't forget. She's killed two people already.

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:41.120
I know that.

00:17:41.120 --> 00:17:43.120
She almost killed Cecil, too.

00:17:43.120 --> 00:17:44.330
I know that!

00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:46.160
There's just something I want to ask her!

00:17:58.950 --> 00:18:00.410
It's so cold...

00:18:11.910 --> 00:18:16.830
An honor to meet you,
descendant of the old blood.

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:20.950
A wizard?

00:18:21.450 --> 00:18:24.910
Indeed. I apologize for being so forward.

00:18:25.040 --> 00:18:27.120
What do you hope to gain by saving me?

00:18:27.290 --> 00:18:28.790
Tell me what it is you desire.

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:31.200
The Book of Niba.

00:18:31.620 --> 00:18:32.500
Oh?

00:18:33.040 --> 00:18:37.790
I thought you might know something
about such an ancient book...

00:18:40.700 --> 00:18:41.870
I understand now.

00:18:42.040 --> 00:18:45.370
Were you the one who had me brought here?

00:18:45.450 --> 00:18:49.000
Not at all. I wish merely to help you.

00:18:49.660 --> 00:18:52.040
I need no help.

00:18:52.750 --> 00:18:54.000
Begone.

00:18:54.330 --> 00:18:58.830
But with your current strength,
you'll be hard-pressed to escape.

00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:00.250
Do you hear?

00:19:03.040 --> 00:19:05.250
Those two...

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:09.700
My, my. They take their jobs very seriously.

00:19:09.830 --> 00:19:11.620
You know them?

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:14.660
A little. Now, hurry.

00:19:14.950 --> 00:19:18.750
I will have this man guide you.

00:19:22.160 --> 00:19:27.160
Shocking... I'm disappointed,
bearer of the old blood.

00:19:31.450 --> 00:19:34.450
I died long ago in an ancient war.

00:19:34.580 --> 00:19:38.160
This is just a brief dream before the end.

00:19:38.790 --> 00:19:40.330
And so...

00:19:44.500 --> 00:19:45.950
Another body.

00:19:45.950 --> 00:19:48.040
A worker? No, but...

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:48.830
Damn you!

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:50.620
Wait! Sheesh...

00:19:56.910 --> 00:19:58.160
She's in the way.

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:04.040
Got her!

00:20:16.910 --> 00:20:18.410
She's so damn tough!

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:29.120
Is that even possible?

00:20:36.950 --> 00:20:38.950
Shit... This is not good!

00:20:40.120 --> 00:20:44.000
Get off! Do you want to die here with me?

00:20:44.120 --> 00:20:48.660
No man has ever survived
three battles with me.

00:20:50.160 --> 00:20:55.580
I see. Perhaps you were the warrior
spoken of in the prophecy.

00:20:57.540 --> 00:20:59.910
Now suffer.

00:21:14.700 --> 00:21:16.790
Is she... dead?

00:21:16.790 --> 00:21:18.040
Looks like it.

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:20.330
She was smashed to pieces, so...

00:21:25.250 --> 00:21:27.040
More importantly, Kei,

00:21:27.040 --> 00:21:29.870
I haven't heard any thank-yous from the man

00:21:29.870 --> 00:21:33.000
who should've been smashed to pieces, too.

00:21:33.000 --> 00:21:34.790
I didn't ask for your help.

00:21:34.790 --> 00:21:36.000
That again?

00:21:36.000 --> 00:21:38.700
What is wrong with you? For one thing--

00:21:38.700 --> 00:21:39.830
Thanks...

00:21:41.450 --> 00:21:44.790
...is a word you'll never hear me say.

00:21:44.790 --> 00:21:46.450
Now let's call for backup.

00:21:49.830 --> 00:21:52.830
Next time I'm not saving you!
Not a chance in hell!

00:21:52.830 --> 00:21:55.120
No matter what!

00:21:55.120 --> 00:21:57.040
Fine!

00:21:57.040 --> 00:21:59.500
Anyway, we need to start on those reports...

00:22:03.500 --> 00:22:07.870
People who get to rest in a coffin
when the sun comes up sure have it easy...

00:23:42.700 --> 00:23:44.910
"Next Time"
Next time on <i>COP CRAFT</i>.
